## Scope of this licence

This licence covers the material authored for these sessions: the lecture notes, the
notebooks, the prompt library, the templates and the Python modules under `workshop/`.

It does not extend to third party material referenced or accessed by this repository.

**MIMIC-IV Clinical Database Demo.** No MIMIC data is redistributed here. The notebooks
read it at runtime from PhysioNet, where it is published under the Open Data Commons Open
Database License v1.0. Use of that data is governed by that licence and by PhysioNet's
terms, not by this one.

    Johnson, A., Bulgarelli, L., Pollard, T., Horng, S., Celi, L. A., & Mark, R. (2023).
    MIMIC-IV Clinical Database Demo (version 2.2). PhysioNet.
    https://doi.org/10.13026/dp1f-ex47

**Cited works.** Papers, guidelines and regulatory documents cited in the lecture notes
remain under their own terms. Citations are provided so that readers can consult the
originals.

**Software dependencies.** scikit-learn, pandas, numpy, matplotlib, gradio and any other
package installed by the notebooks are licensed by their own authors.

