## No warranty and no clinical use

The material is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied.

**Nothing in this repository is a validated clinical tool.** The prototypes built during
the workshop are teaching artefacts, trained on a one hundred patient demonstration
dataset from a single institution. They must not be used for clinical decisions, applied
to real patient data, or deployed in a care setting.

The regulatory material in the lecture notes and in `templates/regulatory-triage.md`
describes the legal position as understood in September 2026. It is not legal advice and
does not substitute for it.
